inline_comments.body:
For compatibility with our existing `NVTE_NORM_FWD_USE_CUDNN` API, the kernel selection logic should be something like:
```
if out is MXFP8:
    if scales are swizzled:
        call TE MXFP8 kernel
    if use_cudnn_norm_fwd():
        call cuDNN kernel
    if dims/dtypes are invalid:
        call cuDNN kernel or error out
    call TE MXFP8 kernel

if use_cudnn_norm_fwd():
    call cuDNN kernel
call TE high-precision/FP8 kernel
```

